'''virginal<sup>2</sup>''' (vėr′jin-a̤l), ''v. i.''; pret. and pp. ''virginaled, virginalled'', ppr. ''virginaling, virginalling''. [< ''virginal''<sup>2</sup>, ''n.''] To finger, as on a virginal; pat or tap with the fingers.

{{smaller block|<poem>Still ''virginalling''
Upon his palm.</poem>
{{right|''Shak.'', W. T., i. 2. 125.}}}}

