'''virginhead†''' (vėr′jin-hed), ''n.'' [< ''virgin'' + ''-head.''] Virginhood; virginity.
{{smaller block|Vnlike it is<br>Such blessed state the noble flowr should miss<br>Of ''Virgin-head.''
